Relationship to Danbooru
------------------------

The code in this repository is original work. It does not contain any code
copied from Danbooru.

The gallery layout was, however, modelled on Danbooru's: specifically its
CSS-grid thumbnail gallery, in which a uniform grid of tracks holds
variable-aspect-ratio previews that are bottom-aligned inside each cell
(`repeat(auto-fill, minmax(Npx, 1fr))` with flex-end preview containers), its
sidebar section ordering, and its convention of colour-coding tags by type
(character, copyright, artist, general, meta). Danbooru is credited here as
the origin of that approach.

Because Fumobooru is a parody of a real site, it is not affiliated with,
endorsed by, or connected to the Danbooru Project or danbooru.donmai.us.

